4-80.jpg 1024w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/Ja9E3u5jvRxpQhBFRo5k5K-970-80.jpg 970w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/Ja9E3u5jvRxpQhBFRo5k5K-750-80.jpg 750w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/Ja9E3u5jvRxpQhBFRo5k5K-650-80.jpg 650w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/Ja9E3u5jvRxpQhBFRo5k5K-480-80.jpg 480w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/Ja9E3u5jvRxpQhBFRo5k5K-320-80.jpg 320w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1000px) 600px, 100vw\" data-new-v2-image=\"true\" data-original-mos=\"https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/Ja9E3u5jvRxpQhBFRo5k5K.jpg\" data-pin-media=\"https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/Ja9E3u5jvRxpQhBFRo5k5K.jpg\" data-pin-nopin=\"true\" fetchpriority=\"high\" data-component-name=\"Image\">\n</picture>\n<figcaption> <span>(Image credit: Future)</span>\n</figcaption>\n</figure></div>\n<div id=\"article-body\">\n\n<DIV><p>Now, enough bad news; the good news is that TV costs haven't been affected yet, and thanks to Best Buy's Labor Day sale, you can get our best-rated TV at its lowest price yet. The retailer has <a data-analytics-id=\"inline-link\" href=\"https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/1943169/614286/10014?subId1=trd-us-8918506420591807409&sharedId=trd-us&u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Flg-65-class-c6-series-oled-evo-ai-4k-smart-webos-tv-2026%2FJJ8VPZKZ8H%2Fsku%2F6673112\" data-url=\"https://www.bestbuy.com/product/lg-65-class-c6-series-oled-evo-ai-4k-smart-webos-tv-2026/JJ8VPZKZ8H/sku/6673112\" target=\"_blank\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\" rel=\"sponsored noopener\" data-hl-processed=\"hawklinks\" data-article-category=\"televisions\" data-google-interstitial=\"false\" data-placeholder-url=\"https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/1943169/614286/10014?subId1=hawk-custom-tracking&sharedId=hawk-prefix&u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Flg-65-class-c6-series-oled-evo-ai-4k-smart-webos-tv-2026%2FJJ8VPZKZ8H%2Fsku%2F6673112\" data-merchant-name=\"Best Buy\" data-merchant-id=\"574517\" data-merchant-network=\"ImpactRadfutureusLlc\" data-merchant-url=\"bestbuy.com\" data-tracking-pixel-url=\"https://imp.pxf.io/i/1943169/4024796/10014\" data-mrf-recirculation=\"inline-link\">LG's 65-inch C6 OLED TV on sale for an incredible price of $1,499.99</a> (originally $2,699.99), thanks to a whopping $1,200 discount.</p><p>The <a data-analytics-id=\"inline-link\" href=\"https://www.techradar.com/televisions/lg-c6-review\" data-url=\"https://www.techradar.com/televisions/lg-c6-review\" data-hl-processed=\"none\" data-article-category=\"televisions\" data-mrf-recirculation=\"inline-link\" data-before-rewrite-localise=\"https://www.techradar.com/televisions/lg-c6-review\">LG C6</a> was released in March of this year and has already been crowned TechRadar's <a data-analytics-id=\"inline-link\" href=\"https://www.techradar.com/news/best-tv\" data-url=\"https://www.techradar.com/news/best-tv\" data-hl-processed=\"none\" data-article-category=\"televisions\" data-mrf-recirculation=\"inline-link\" data-before-rewrite-localise=\"https://www.techradar.com/news/best-tv\">best TV</a> of 2026. The <a data-analytics-id=\"inline-link\" href=\"https://www.techradar.com/tag/lg\" data-auto-tag-linker=\"true\" data-url=\"https://www.techradar.com/tag/lg\" data-hl-processed=\"none\" data-article-category=\"televisions\" data-mrf-recirculation=\"inline-link\" data-before-rewrite-localise=\"https://www.techradar.com/tag/lg\">LG</a> C6 is the successor to the popular <a data-analytics-id=\"inline-link\" href=\"https://www.techradar.com/televisions/lg-c5-oled-tv-review\" data-url=\"https://www.techradar.com/televisions/lg-c5-oled-tv-review\" data-hl-processed=\"none\" data-article-category=\"televisions\" data-mrf-recirculation=\"inline-link\" data-before-rewrite-localise=\"https://www.techradar.com/televisions/lg-c5-oled-tv-review\">LG C5</a>, and in our review it earned five out of five stars, and we said it was 'a notable upgrade over its predecessor.' The LG C6 includes a speedy Alpha 11 AI processor and delivers brighter, more accurate colors and powerful contrast. You also get impressive gaming features and sound, and LG's webOS 26 smart platform, which includes new AI features.</p></DIV><h2 id=\"save-1-200-on-lg-39-s-c6-oled-tv-3\">Save $1,200 on LG's C6 OLED TV</h2><DIV id=\"elk-caa1ce5e-a564-11f1-be81-8dcecd9336b5\"><p>I've listed more of Best Buy's top Labor Day TV deals below, including record-low prices on a range of <a data-analytics-id=\"inline-link\" href=\"https://www.techradar.com/tag/4k\" data-auto-tag-linker=\"true\" data-url=\"https://www.techradar.com/tag/4k\" data-hl-processed=\"none\" data-article-category=\"televisions\" data-mrf-recirculation=\"inline-link\" data-before-rewrite-localise=\"https://www.techradar.com/tag/4k\">4K</a>, QLED, and <a data-analytics-id=\"inline-link\" href=\"https://www.techradar.com/tag/oled\" data-auto-tag-linker=\"true\" data-url=\"https://www.techradar.com/tag/oled\" data-hl-processed=\"none\" data-article-category=\"televisions\" data-mrf-recirculation=\"inline-link\" data-before-rewrite-localise=\"https://www.techradar.com/tag/oled\">OLED</a> TVs.</p><p>Keep in mind that today's discount on LG's C6 OLED TV is a limited-time offer, and it's the lowest price we've ever seen for the 65-inch model. If you want to grab a premium display at an excellent price before potential RAM price hikes hit, then you should take advantage of this incredible deal at Best Buy.</p></DIV><h2 id=\"shop-more-of-the-top-tv-deals-at-best-buy-3\">Shop more of the top TV deals at Best Buy</h2><h2 id=\"see-more-of-today-39-s-best-labor-day-sales-3\">See more of today's best Labor Day sales</h2><ul id=\"elk-8f9e2a5e-a565-11f1-a813-ffc09c207219\"><li><strong>Amazon:</strong> <a href=\"https://target.georiot.com/Proxy.ashx?tsid=8428&GR_URL=https%3A%2F%2Famazon.com%2Fdeals%3Fref_%3Dnav_cs_gb%26tag%3Dftr-techradar-us-20%26ascsubtag%3Dtrd-us-1908762175466928655-20\" data-url=\"https://www.amazon.com/deals?ref_=nav_cs_gb\" target=\"_blank\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\" rel=\